{
  "uid": "aerotrace-kafka-streams",
  "title": "AeroTrace - Kafka Streams",
  "tags": [
    "aerotrace",
    "kafka"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Other AeroTrace dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "aerotrace"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "application",
        "label": "Application",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(kafka_stream_client_state, application)",
          "refId": "application"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(kafka_stream_client_state, application)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this page",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This page is about **Kafka Streams applications**; today that is the `risk-streams-service`. Pick the application at the top. The numbers come from the Streams metrics the service exports plus its own counters. For the producers of the other services see the *Kafka Topics* dashboard.\n\n* **Streams state** - `Running` is healthy. `Rebalancing` is normal for a few seconds after a start; `Error` or `Not running` means the application stopped.\n* **Bags at HIGH risk now** (`baggage_risk_high`) - legs that leave soon and are not loaded yet.\n* **Stream lag** (`stream_lag_seconds`) - wall-clock time minus the event time of the last record processed.\n* **Risk changes, Anomalies, Dead letters** - events the topology wrote to `baggage.risk.changed.v1`, `baggage.scan.anomaly.v1` and `baggage.dead-letter.v1` in the selected time range.\n* **Late records** - scans older than the grace period; they still update risk but are left out of the anomaly window. **Scans without a leg** - accepted, but no risk can be computed for them.\n* **Processing errors / Failed stream threads** - anything above 0 needs a look (poison records go to the dead-letter topic).\n* **Stored keys per state store** - size of the four RocksDB stores (dedup, leg state, departure index, anomaly window).\n\nTo look inside the topics and the consumer group use [Open Kafka UI](http://localhost:8090/ui/clusters/local/consumer-groups/risk-streams-service)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Streams state",
      "description": "State of the Kafka Streams client. Running is healthy.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "noValue": "No data",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Created",
                  "color": "blue",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Rebalancing",
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "Running",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 2
                },
                "3": {
                  "text": "Pending shutdown",
                  "color": "orange",
                  "index": 3
                },
                "4": {
                  "text": "Not running",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 4
                },
                "5": {
                  "text": "Pending error",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 5
                },
                "6": {
                  "text": "Error",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 6
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(kafka_stream_client_state{application=~\"$application\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ]
